{"product_id":"sigma-smartwatch","title":"Sigma Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe All New Sigma gives your lifestyle a new dimension in Smartwatches with a 2.01” IPS Curved HD Display paired with a Textured Silicon Strap and a fully functioning Rotating Crown enabled with Smart Notifications, Smart Workout Modes, Health Suite and 100+ Smartwatch Faces, AI Assistant and a 5 Day Battery Life Without Charge to level up your daily activities!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Sigma:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Sigma is embossed with a 2.01” IPS Curved HD Display\u003cbr\u003eFully Rotating Crown \u003cbr\u003eA Textured Silicon Strap with complete health tracking, workout modes and smart notifications for BT Calling, Text Messaging and AI Voice Assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Sigma:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, Multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Orange Titanium","offer_id":48864495763734,"sku":"20562","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":48864495665430,"sku":"20561","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Starlight Black","offer_id":488644